     5563   tt-fin-doc.PS
     5564   tt-fin-doc.payer-kpp
     5565   tt-fin-doc.receiver-kpp
     5566   with frame Dialog-Frame.
     5567   .
     5568   if tt-fin-doc.contract-code <> 0 then do:
